# Billing (overview v3.1)

Every tier receives **unlimited** ratings. The cap applies only to ratings **given**.

| Tier | Price | Given / month | Themes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Basic | QAR 0 | 25 | 5 card themes |
| Pro | ~QAR 99 / year | 60 | Many themes, kept updated + custom |
| Business | QAR 20–30 / employee / month | 50 per employee | Many + custom + **company-branded** |

## Rules

- Never cap ratings **received** on any tier
- Enforce give-caps server-side (month window, Business per employee)
- Themes are cosmetic; they must not change score math or verification
- Super Voter is **never** a paid SKU

```ts
// ❌ BAD — limit inbound ratings for Basic
if (tier === 'basic' && receivedThisMonth >= 25) reject()

// ✅ GOOD — cap outbound ratings only
if (givenThisMonth >= capFor(tier)) rejectGive()
```

Billing providers are client-paid; implement the interface and entitlements first.
